<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 395-7 VS ZIMBABWE (375) AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 395-7 VS ZIMBABWE (375) AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>SHEIKHUPURA, Pakistan 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan were 395 for seven in reply to Zimbabwe's first innings 375 at the close of the third day of the first cricket test on Saturday.</p>
</text>
